{"id":"MOEX-112100-1301-Q080","title":"Pol I有三種活性：缺少的是3′→5′ DNA聚合","version":"v4","batch":"112-2-med1-q51-100","sourceSha256":"f85260e5cbcd7d3ee709b47fde5baa7d0b9b1a5b5ba65d5fba7b782f3b93e24e","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>B</strong>。大腸桿菌<strong>DNA聚合酶I（DNA polymerase I，Pol I）</strong>具有<strong>5′→3′ DNA聚合、3′→5′核酸外切及5′→3′核酸外切</strong>三種活性；沒有3′→5′ DNA聚合活性。</p>","html":"<h2>Pol I有三種活性：缺少的是3′→5′ DNA聚合</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：B</p><h3>先固定新股生長方向</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>B</strong>。大腸桿菌<strong>DNA聚合酶I（DNA polymerase I，Pol I）</strong>具有<strong>5′→3′ DNA聚合、3′→5′核酸外切及5′→3′核酸外切</strong>三種活性；沒有3′→5′ DNA聚合活性。</p>\n<p>聚合酶把新核苷酸加到既有新股的<strong>3′-OH端</strong>，所以新股只能沿<strong>5′→3′</strong>方向延長。它讀取模板的方向是3′→5′，但<strong>讀模板的方向不等於合成新股的方向</strong>，這正是B最容易混淆之處。</p>\n<h3>「往回切」是校對，不是往回合成</h3>\n<p>當新股3′端出現錯配，Pol I的<strong>3′→5′核酸外切酶（exonuclease）</strong>可從末端移除錯誤核苷酸，再恢復5′→3′合成。圖中出錯的A被移除後再接上正確G，就是這種<strong>校對（proofreading）</strong>與合成的切換。</p>\n<h3>另外一個方向的切除，用於處理前方片段</h3>\n<p>Pol I的<strong>5′→3′核酸外切活性</strong>可切除前方的RNA引子或核酸片段，同時在後方以DNA填補，使缺口的位置往前移，稱為<strong>缺口平移（nick translation）</strong>。核酸外切活性是從末端切除；不能只看到5′→3′就把所有活動都當成聚合。</p>\n<div></div>\n<div><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1920px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.9767441860465116\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0b30d3255bea07d224fe5e30524271bb71c4fcd3ba2565352df315075cf8d601.png\" alt=\"原圖上段：核苷酸加入DNA新股的3端\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"645\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0b30d3255bea07d224fe5e30524271bb71c4fcd3ba2565352df315075cf8d601.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>合成：新股上方是左5′、右3′，新核苷酸接在3′端。原圖上段面板。 圖：Madprime；CC BY-SA 3.0；<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DNA_polymerase.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖</a>／<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">授權</a>。</figcaption></figure><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1920px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.355828220858896\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/248bbe775d1e9820de1c5fa5dd7afd80b55b5b1c5d327f8b5db32b6b72f2bfe1.png\" alt=\"原圖校對段：從3端移除錯誤核苷酸\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"815\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/248bbe775d1e9820de1c5fa5dd7afd80b55b5b1c5d327f8b5db32b6b72f2bfe1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>校對：錯配的末端A被移除，再恢復合成。兩圖為通用聚合／校對示意，未畫Pol I的5′外切活性。原圖校對面板，沿空白處裁邊。 圖：Madprime；CC BY-SA 3.0；<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DNA_polymerase.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖</a>／<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">授權</a>。</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Pol I活性</th><th>主要用途</th><th>對應選項</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5′→3′聚合</td><td>由3′-OH端加入dNTP，填補DNA</td><td>A：具有</td></tr><tr><td>3′→5′核酸外切</td><td>移除新股末端錯配，進行校對</td><td>D：具有</td></tr><tr><td>5′→3′核酸外切</td><td>切除前方引子／片段，參與缺口平移</td><td>C：具有</td></tr><tr><td>3′→5′聚合</td><td>不是Pol I的新股合成方式</td><td><strong>B：沒有</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div><h3>常考延伸：Pol III與Klenow片段</h3>\n<p>大腸桿菌染色體複製的主要延長酵素是<strong>Pol III</strong>，Pol I主要參與引子處理、填補與修復。<strong>Klenow大片段</strong>是Pol I移去5′→3′外切酶結構域後的片段，保留聚合與3′→5′校對；不能把「Klenow缺少5′外切」誤套回完整Pol I。</p><details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼1301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?code=112100&amp;t=A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2023-09-05更正清冊：本科無更正紀錄</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P00582/entry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">UniProtKB P00582：E. coli Pol I的聚合及兩種外切活性（官方JSON已保存）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/14-4-dna-replication-in-prokaryotes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax Biology：新股方向、Pol I引子替換與Pol III延長</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DNA_polymerase.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Madprime：延長與校對示意（圖片與授權）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.neb.com/en-us/products/m0210-dna-polymerase-i-large-klenow-fragment\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NEB Klenow：保留聚合與3′外切、缺5′外切（功能定義）</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：B"}